      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This would require (should) a rebuild on upgrade to 3.4 to ensure everyone's databases are consistent - we may want to consider whether or not we include it in 3.4 on that basis</p>",
