      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This is minor, but just so it's documented: additional storage requirement for LONGTEXT vs TEXT in MySQL is 2 bytes: <a href=\"http://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.0/en/storage-requirements.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.0/en/storage-requirements.html</a></p>",
     "created": "27/Apr/10 1:16 PM",
